---
---

<section class="sec scent" id="scent">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><b>05</b> Beyond body cream</span>
        <h2 class="display">Find a scent that<br />suits you, too.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sec-head__lede">
        A fragrance you love can undo a routine that works. The same scan reads scent the
        way it reads cream: what is in it, what it is for, and whether your skin is likely
        to agree.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="split split--scent">
      <div class="reveal">
        <ul class="chips">
          <li class="chip"><i></i> Fragrance allergens named</li>
          <li class="chip"><i></i> Reasons, not stars</li>
          <li class="chip"><i></i> Occasion-aware</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="scentcard">
          <span class="scentcard__k">Sample scent profile</span>
          <div class="scentcard__row">
            <b>Warm floral</b>
            <span>Amber · jasmine · cedar</span>
          </div>
          <div class="scentcard__row">
            <b>Skin fit</b>
            <span>Low allergen load · 0.78 confidence</span>
          </div>
          <p class="scentcard__note">
            Matched to your profile, with the notes that drove the choice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="scent__stage reveal">
        <img
          src="/images/fragrance-vial.webp"
          width="900"
          height="900"
          alt="A small unbranded glass fragrance vial on pale travertine, dried stems behind."
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <span class="tagchip tagchip--c"><i></i> Low allergen load</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
